/*! \page sdk_class_c_cuda Class-C Native and Process Authoring

Markdown companion: \c docs/class_c_cuda_process_authoring.md.

\section sdk_c_place Placements

Native CPU/CUDA, supervised process SHM, supervised process CUDA-IPC, and
independent portable E3 consumers. Producers never wait.

Python research packages (\c class_c_python_*d) use the supervised process path
only; CPython is not supported for Class-A/B or in-process MODULEs and is not a
production performance path.

\section sdk_c_export CUDA process export pool

One D2D snapshot per publication into a fixed route-owned pool; worker imports
handles once; lease completion reclaims slots. Honest one-copy isolation, not a
malicious-GPU security boundary.

\section sdk_c_obs Authority

Single spectrum result authority; observers may coexist. See
\ref sdk_observer_authority.

*/
